$date
	Tue Oct 27 12:00:00 2026
$end
$version
	QuestaSim Version 2023.3_1
$end
$comment
	A Questa 2023 VCD that writes a variable of an enum type as "integer 32", the enum's code as its value
	(tests/unit/types/int_enum.types.json: their types). r_state, next_state, act_edge_sel: codes of their
	enums; r_odd: 6 is no code of its enum; r_lost: only x (as wlf2vcd writes an enum); r_wide: a reg of 32
	bits, not an integer: its width is not the enum's, left as it is.
$end
$timescale
	1ns
$end
$scope module top $end
$var reg 1 ! clk $end
$scope module dec $end
$var wire 1 " clk $end
$var integer 32 # r_state $end
$var integer 32 $ next_state $end
$var integer 32 % act_edge_sel $end
$var integer 32 & r_odd $end
$var integer 32 ' r_lost $end
$var reg 32 ( r_wide [31:0] $end
$upscope $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
